{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>ויאמר, פָּרְקוּ.</b> On the pattern of בָּרְכוּ, from the heavy binyan with dagesh. It was the custom of Egypt to put earrings in their ears, and so it is written concerning the Midianites, 'for Ishmaelites they are' (Judges 8:24)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:38.607855328Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}